      "comment": "CONQUEROR (4) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Faded to finish fifth over 530m at Angle Park (31.57) in a Grade 4/5 but is better placed coming back in trip. Has a strong winning record at this journey including one wins. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Better than last start and worth following up. SPONSORSHIP (2) racing well without winning, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 2nd over 300m at this track beaten 1.75 lengths (17.16) behind Make Some Noise in a Grade 5 on August 5. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Well-placed to take this out. SHINY PISTOL (1) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 6 lengths (17.41) at this track in a Other over 300m. Leading player again. IMPRESS SEMINYAK (8) looks a top-three hope after a break.",
